window.products.push({"id":485016,"name":"The Rustic House Candles Soy Wax Candle Home Decor | Non Toxic Candles Long Burning Candles | Hand Poured Soy Candle Aesthetic Candles in Glass Contai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714sAWzBStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RELAXING CANDLE SCENT THAT SOOTHES YOUR SENSES – We only use the highest quality soy candles essential oils and finest fragrances to create our soy wax candles; it's one of the best strong scented candles for big rooms because of its strong scent throw; we have worked closely with chemists over the years to create a scent line that is unique to The Rustic House; not only do we take pride in the scents we carry; we also care deeply about the quality of our soy candle FIND THE PERFECT LONG LASTING SCENTED CANDLES FOR YOU - Inspired by the scents of popular herbs and spices, our soy candles essential oils have a variety of candle scents such as fall candle, autumn candle, lavender candle, sandalwood candles, vanilla candle, lemon candles highly scented, eucalyptus candles, pumpkin chai candle; from subtle sweetness to smells of freshening evergreens, you'll surely find a scent that could match your moods and needs PERFECT HOUSE WARMING GIFTS NEW HOME: The Rustic House home candles unites the best of the traditional and the new, with a candle decor designed to complement any home decor; give these as housewarming gift, new home candle gift, fall gifts, home welcoming gifts, gift candle, candles gifts for women and candle gift set as these will add to the aesthetic design of your homes, spa or lounge LONG LASTING SCENTED CANDLES – We use sustainable, American-raised soy wax and 100% cotton wick for our slow burning candles; these scented candles in glass are made with naturally sourced materials free of contamination; also, the wick will not taint walls or delicate fabrics; just make sure you trim the wick after each burn (to ¼ inch) to ensure the longevity of your soy candles scented SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: If you're not satisfied at any time or if you have any product related question, please contact us or post a question here and we will follow up to make sure your shopping experience is amazing","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714sAWzBStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRH The Rustic House","source_asin":"B0BMKGTX6P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMKGTX6P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMKGTX6P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485017,"name":"LazBlinds Custom Cut to Size No Tools-No Drill 1\" Aluminum Mini Blinds, Cordless Blinds for Windows, Light Filtering Horizontal Window Blinds, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413F9TKyblL._AC_.jpg","description":"Custom Cut to Size: Each blinds will be customzied according to your exact window size, and can't be sold after a return. We appreciate customer's precise measures & careful orders, and avoid returns without quality issues. For the inside mount, a standard 2/5 inch deduction is made to the top rail width for a proper INSIDE MOUNT fit. For the outside mount, add 1-4 inches wider to your window opening width for better light blocking. No Drill Blinds: No need to drill any holes on your window frame, great for Renter, Landlord, and Home Buyer. Easy to Install in 30 seconds with no tools-no drill, screws, or brackets. Fit All Kinds of Walls, like woodiness metope, tile marble, concrete wall and rough tile. Light Filtering: Classic Aluminum Mini Blinds, plastic tilt wand makes slats 180 degree turning to control light, block UV rays and provide privacy. Great for all indoor areas such as kitchen, living room, family room, bedroom, bathroom, study, office, nursery. Cordless Blinds for Windows: The cord-free design provides a clean, tangle-free look to the window and creates a safer environment for children and pets. Easy to raise up or lower down to gently filter sunlight. Lead Time and Service: We need 2 working days to complete your customized products after the order confirmation. 5-7 working days for transportation. If you have any issues or questions in the process of purchasing, installing or using, please feel free to email to us by Amazon message and we will respond to you within 24 hours. Please keep checking and responding to your Amazon messages until you get our confirmation on the order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413F9TKyblL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LazBlinds","source_asin":"B0BY375HMB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY375HMB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY375HMB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
