window.products.push({"id":485021,"name":"BurstEay Pizza Stone for Crispy Crust Pizza, 12''x 15''Rectangular Engineered Tuff Cordierite Durable Baking Stones for Ovens & Grill & BBQ, Cooking &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TD7aUPBoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Includes: One Pizza Stone 15\"x12\", One Free Plastic Scraper. How to Use Pizza Stone It is important to know that pizza stone without preheating will not cook evenly. Please preheat the stone before placing food on it. 1. Place the pizza stone itself in middle of oven or grill and pre-heat it at 500° F (260° C) for about 30 minutes. 2. Sprinkle flour or cornmeal on top of the stone to create a non-stick surface. 3. Return both stone and pizza to the grill or oven, close the grill lid and cook the pizza for 10 to 12 minutes. 4. Check in halfway to ensure the pizza is not overheated. 5. Once the crust is brown, remove the pizza from stone. Enjoy at once. How to Clean a Pizza Stone 1. Let the stone completely cool off before washing. 2. Never use soap or detergent on a stone, which will leave a soapy aftertaste. 3. Hand wash with warm water. Not dishwasher safe. 4. Use the scraper, brush or nylon pad to remove excess food.  5. Dry the stone in an oven completely after cleaning. 6. Store the stone in a clean & dry place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TD7aUPBoL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BurstEay","source_asin":"B08CXSPQKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CXSPQKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CXSPQKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
