window.products.push({"id":485276,"name":"XELDA Manual Can Opener: Stainless Steel Lid Lifter With Sharp Blade, Smooth Edge, Soft Handles –Professional Kitchen Tool To Open Cans And Glass Bott","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51687HzMQBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing The XELDA Manual Can Opener The XELDA Manual Can Opener will add value to your kitchen and is a necessity when it comes to preparing foods for your guests. Opening tin cans, canned goods, and other similar metal containers has never been easier with our XELDA can opener. The long handles and the oversized knob will allow you to open any can with ease. And your hand will be scratch-and cut-free. A 2-in-1 Kitchen Tool The XELDA can opener has been specially designed to open metal containers AND remove the metal caps of glass bottles of beers and refreshments. This practical 2-in-1 kitchen tool is a must-have item for any household and any bar, coffee shop or restaurant. We help you save both money and space. Designed To Be Comfortable And Easy To Use Here at XELDA we wanted to make sure that our manual can opener is not only practical, but also comfortable. For this reason, we made sure that the handles are cushioned, nonslip and ergonomically designed. At the same time, the can opener is very lightweight, so you will be able to open all cans with precision. The Most Durable Manual Can Opener Made with high quality stainless steel, the XELDA can opener will never rust, bend, break, or lose its sharpness. Thanks to the heavy duty materials and smart design of the can opener, this is a purchase you won’t regret. Purchase a XELDA can opener now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51687HzMQBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XELDA","source_asin":"B077Y68G1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077Y68G1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077Y68G1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485277,"name":"Pingo World 0622Q9ORUWG Life is Beautiful Gallery Wrapped Canvas Print 45 X 30. Bonus Banksy Wall Decal, 45\" x 30\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-iqeKGNAL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","description":"Banksy Life Is Beautiful. Gallery wrap on archival quality canvas using Epson Ultra-Chrome inks and pine wood frames. BONUS! FREE BANKSY 17\"X12\" REMOVABLE WALL DECAL WITH PURCHASE. Quality Guaranteed. Brand new, made to order. Top Quality Fredrix Archival Canvas. Epson Printers and Inks. Professionally stretched around solid pine wood frames. Shipped in custom made boxes with protective sides. Comes Ready to Hang. Free Shipping. Life Expectancy Over 100 Years. Money Back Guarantee. 100% Made in USA. About Banksy Despite not calling himself an artist, Banksy has been considered by some as talented in that respect; he uses his original street art form, combined with Banksy stencil style. Due to the shroud of secrecy surrounding his real identity and his subversive character, Banksy has achieved somewhat of a cult following with his street art from some of the younger age group within the stenciling community. Tagging walls and billboards in the dark of night, sneaking around with a secret identity in urban areas. Leaving his political mark on the world for all to enjoy for free. The infamous UK guerrilla artist, Banksy, is hitting the streets hard in London, Bristol, Australia, the USA, and just about everywhere in between. It’s not only the curiosity of his identity that makes the artist famous, it’s his impeccable political pieces and artwork that stir up discussions on the underlying themes. By calling attention to the issues depicted in his pieces, Banksy’s controversial work requires people to think deeply about the issues he’s attempting to bring to light. About Our Products We pride ourselves on using only the highest quality materials that produced in USA. All of the materials we use are sourced from US-based vendors, we do not buy from China.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-iqeKGNAL._AC_SL1012_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pingo World","source_asin":"B01HFLI7MY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HFLI7MY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HFLI7MY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
