window.products.push({"id":485332,"name":"650 Thread Count Egyptian Cotton Sheet Set | Hotel Luxury 4-Piece Sheet Sets | Pillowcases, Fitted & Flat Sheets Included, California King, Teal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uunoCvBtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our 100% Egyptian Cotton 650 Thread Count Sheets Sets are the perfect sheets for anyone looking for the softness of a lower thread count with the durability and thickness of the high thread count sheet. You will not find a sheet that offers this level of comfort and softness along with the the physical integrity and thickness. They're available in multiple size ranges and colors making up almost 200 options! Whether the sheets are a gift for a friend or you are buying for yourself, you know you are getting top-quality luxury with Exceptional Sheets. Egyptian Cotton: Why is Egyptian cotton so much better for your sheets? Quite simply, Egyptian cotton produces longer fibers (up to twice as long as a standard cotton fiber). The longer fibers or staples are easily spun into finer count yarns, and turned into the softest sheets you will ever sleep on. It's that simple! Single Ply: \"Ply\" refers to the number of yarns wrapped together in a single thread. The process of plying creates thicker threads, which will impact a sheet's feel and durability. Finer threads allow for higher thread counts resulting in a softer sheet with an elegant drape. Our Single ply sheets use individual, un-plied threads in the weaving process, resulting in lighter-weight fabric with exceptional drape and softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uunoCvBtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ExceptionalSheets","source_asin":"B00KSM4XI0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KSM4XI0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KSM4XI0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485333,"name":"KULiving Silicone Kitchen Mat Combo - Large Gray Kitchen Dish Drying Mat & Sink Faucet Splash Guard 12\"x16\" & 19\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aTt+E2E1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Having durable and enduring gadgets for your home are a great way in saving time and energy. Meet your new multi solution accessories to help keep your sink area, countertops and backsplash dry and protected! Avoid water damage to surfaces and counter. Large 2 PC matching gray set includes: 1 sink mat for faucet 19.25 x 5.5 x .44 inches (48x14cm); diameter single faucet hole 2.25 in (5.7cm). Incompatible: Mesa narrow, protrusions, outside basin, side faucets, round or wall-mounted sinks. 1 silicone kitchen drying mat (15.7 x 12.06 x .0625 inches / 30x41cm) Made of premium quality, food grade, eco, silicone. Why ours over microfiber absorbent pads, rubber, cloth, towel, plastic, stone? Cold (-40°F), heat (up tp 464°F /240°C), odor, tear, slip resistant. Reliable, durable, non streak, heavy duty, moisture and waterproof benefits. Germ-free lifestyle preventing growth of germs and mold. Dishwasher safe. Easy clean, quick rinse. Hang dish mat option. Tired of messy space or clutter? Lightweight and soft splash guard for sink and drying mat are a great space saver for easy store, simply roll or fold away. The handle drip catcher tray brings room for dish and hand soap, lotion and sponge holder. Featuring the faucet mat and large dish drying mat with a minimalist low-profile, allowing your kitchen to look neat. The unique design, raised edges and ridges facilitate drying by maximizing drainage and aeration plus preventing water leakage onto countertop. Easy install sink mat's polyline design is a grout protector from water pooling behind faucet. Dishes, glassware, baby bottle, dry faster on the non skid streamline design. Do you love options? Dish mat multi-use: trivet, fridge / drawer liner, pet feeding, under sink, washer dryer laundry top, coffee maker and air fryer mat, drainboard and use on your islands, farmhouse, bathroom, RV or camper. Up your kitchen game! Don't delay, purchase your must haves today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aTt+E2E1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BY9YN2FF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY9YN2FF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY9YN2FF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
