window.products.push({"id":485433,"name":"Linon Isabelle Square Wood Upholstered Ottoman in Natural Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":184.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-FzJhB7AL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Isabelle Square Ottoman is a stylish and versatile addition to your home's décor. Perfect for use as an ottoman or coffee table, the piece has a tufted top upholstered in a natural linen fabric. Burnished Bronze nailheads accent the side, while turned dark espresso finished legs complete the piece.Features :- Crafted from Birch, Fabric, CA Firefoam and Metal Casters- Dark Espresso Finish- Natural Linen Beige Upholstery (100% Polyester)- Burnished Bronze Nailheads- Chic, sophisticated square design- Tufted Top.Specifications :- Assembly Required : Some Assembly Required- Product Dimensions : 34.63\"w x 34.63\"d x 17.72\"h- Product Weight : 30.87 lbs- Seat Height : 17.72\"- Seat Dimensions : 34.63\" x 34.63\"- Weight Capacity : 275 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-FzJhB7AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linon","source_asin":"B010GJGSR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485433","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010GJGSR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010GJGSR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485434,"name":"Kaxich 6pcs Santa Claus Red Hat Cap Chair Seats Cover Christmas Dinner Table Party Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t9b5ZJAEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Features: Ideal Christmas gift for your friends and family. A lovely soft chair covers for Christmas to decorate the home and catch people's sight. Specifications: Material: Non Woven Fabric Color: Red and white Size: 60 x 50cm/23.6 x 19.68 inch Package Content: 6 x Chair Seats Cover Note: 1.The actual item's color maybe slightly different from the pictures shown due to the lighting or computer screens. 2.If our products have any quality problems, please do not hesitate to contact us, we offer 100 percent money back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51t9b5ZJAEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kaxich","source_asin":"B07HMNFK4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HMNFK4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HMNFK4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485435,"name":"Rattan Ottoman Pouf FootStool Nikki with Cushion (Light Brown)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MxbN2tEpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How is the Furniture Constructed ? The rattan is placed in a steam box which is necessary for bending the rattan and making it more pliable. Jigs are constructed for producing specific shapes. When the rattan is steaming hot, it is bent to fit into the jig. Once cooled, the rattan will remain in that shape. The shaped poles are assembled with straight poles that are contoured to fit joints evenly. Our furniture is constructed only with quality hardware. The joints where the two pieces meet are wrapped chiefly with peel / wicker / leather bindings. How is the Furniture Finished ? Once the furniture is complete, combinations of latex and alcohol base stains are used to obtain a homogeneous finish. Painstaking detail is used to prepare and sand each piece for a clean, smooth surface. Product Care - Maintenance & Cleaning. Do not allow your rattan furniture to be exposed to harsh Ultraviolet sunlight for prolonged periods of time, as this can affect the color. Turn the cushions periodically. Gently wipe over the frames with a moist, clean cloth to remove dust or spills and vacuum the woven parts with a soft brush attachment. For major liquid spills, remove all upholstery and place outside or in a drying room to dry. Please note that it is important that the furniture is dried and not remain wet or damp for any length of time as this will result in mould and subsequent deterioration of the rattan furniture. Rattan furniture is a natural handmade product and will absorb moisture and dry out in direct relation to climate conditions. To avoid any deterioration it is recommended that the environment be dry and well ventilated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MxbN2tEpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rattan Wicker Home Furniture","source_asin":"B01G81241M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01G81241M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01G81241M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485436,"name":"FHE Group Pliio Clothing Pilers, Set of 7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IW476lo8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Pliio Clothing Piler is here to rescue your messy piles of clothes. Simply fold your golf shirts, t-shirts, long sleeve tops and sweaters around a Clothing Piler and it will be perfectly folded and easy to manage. In fact, when you open your closet it will feel as if you're visiting your own boutique every morning. Don't be surprised if you find yourself inviting friends over to admire your wardrobe. It looks that good. If you really feel like showing off, don't hesitate to post a picture on your favourite social media channel with #showoffyourdrawers! Celebrate! The days of not wearing the shirt on the bottom of a pile are over! Medium Clothing Piler- The medium Clothing Piler will fit most tops, sweaters, and dresses from youth size 8-10 through adult XL.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IW476lo8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EHF","source_asin":"B01HK569WK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HK569WK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HK569WK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
