window.products.push({"id":485511,"name":"AeraVida Majestic Elephant Hand Carved Teak Wood Wall Art | Handmade Teak Wood Wall Art | Home Decor Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SNO2SsI8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An ancient symbol of power and wisdom, the elephant has a long and storied history with the people of Thailand. Artisan Thanat meticulously works with chisel and knife to achieve the fine details in this amazing carving. This piece is constructed from Teak Wood and measures in at 6 inches square. This handcrafted carving works great as an accent piece in hallways or adorning the walls in bathrooms. Add a taste of Thai and Southeast Asian flair to your home with this stunning piece! PLEASE NOTE: The handcrafted nature of this product will produce minor differences in design, sizing and weight. Variations will occur from piece to piece, measurements may vary slightly. Packaged in AERAVIDA branded environmentally sustainable packaging. AERAVIDA works directly with gifted and talented Artisans from all over the world. At the core of our philosophy is fair trade and fostering a sustainable future for our Artisans. ARTISAN STORY: Thanat has been drawing inspiration from the rich cultural heritage of his homeland to express his artistic talents for nearly ten years. He has a small workshop in Northern Thailand, where he and other family members practice their craftsmanship. At his workshop, only manual tools are used which helps achieve finely detailed work and artistry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SNO2SsI8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AeraVida","source_asin":"B079N8VVXR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079N8VVXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079N8VVXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
