window.products.push({"id":485623,"name":"ArtToFrames Double-Multimat-211-61/89-FRBW26079 Collage Photo Frame Double Mat with 3-4x6 Openings and Satin Black Frame, Super White, 3-4x6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dNRGYyNeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your one-of-a-kind photos deserve one-of-a-kind frames, but visiting a custom frame shop can be time consuming and expensive. Art to Frames extensive and growing line of inexpensive multi opening Photo Mats will get you the look you want at a price you can afford. Our Photo Mats come in a variety of sizes and colors and can be custom made to your needs. Frame choices range from traditional to contemporary, with both single and multiple photo opening mat options. With our large selection of custom frame and mat choices, the design possibilities are limitless. When you're done, you'll have a unique custom framed photo that will look like you spent a fortune at a frame shop. Your frame will be delivered directly to your front door or sent as a gift straight to your recipient. Product SKU No. Double-Multimat-211-61/89-FRBW26079.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31dNRGYyNeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtToFrames","source_asin":"B018MJC55I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018MJC55I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018MJC55I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485624,"name":"Blue Angel with Candles - German Pewter Christmas Tree Ornament - by Kuhn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511hwkfEQPL._AC_.jpg","description":"We hope you enjoy this beautiful pewter ornament from Kuhn. Kuhn Pewter was founded in 1960, and has been run as a family business since then. Today it is one of the world-wide leading manufacturers of outstanding artistic pewter items. Their studio is located south of the old independent city of Augsburg, in the area of southern Germany, known as Bavaria. Since 1975, pewter articles have become their main product line. All models designs are created by artists and are taken from different motifs found in fairy tales, literature, folk art, historical toys, old occupations, heralds, old houses and different antiques. Customers and collectors appreciate their historical designs, handwork and quality, and therefore are ready to pay a reasonable price for a valuable product. Your great grandchildren can enjoy these fine ornaments if they are treated with care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511hwkfEQPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A Bit of Britain","source_asin":"B07482TXZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07482TXZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07482TXZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
