window.products.push({"id":485642,"name":"Round Cooling Rack - 3 Pack Steamer Racks Set - Stainless Steel Circle Roasting Rack, 3 Pcs (8\" & 9\" & 10\") Steaming Cake Pot Rack with Hot Dish Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-kjn26OYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【MULTIPLE SIZE COMBINATIONS】 Are you still worried about choosing a size for Cooking Rack? We have different sizes of steaming racks to meet your different needs. 8”& 9”& 10” is very suitable for an air fryer, metal steamer, bamboo steamer, toaster oven, rice cooker, etc. A good cooling rack does not pick the pot. We also prepare an anti-scalding clip for you， prevent you from being burned. 👍【HIGH-QUALITY】 The cooling rack is made of stainless steel, which is durable and can be used safely at 500 degrees Fahrenheit. Cooling racks can be safely used for food. The bottom of the Steaming Grilling Rack is smooth as a whole to prevent the pan from scratching. The Circular Wire Rack is connected by multiple welding points, which is firm and not easy to fall apart. You don't need to worry about placing the load-bearing pots and pans to fall apart. 👍【UNIQUE DESIGN】 The Round Cooking Rack adopts grid design and high feet. The cooling racks can lift the food to the surface of the pot, allowing air to circulate in all directions of the food, and at the same time prevent the food from being submerged in the water so that the steaming is even and the cooking is rapid. Let your food cool down faster, reduce the time of belly rumbling, cook restaurant-quality food with love so that you have more time to taste together with family and friends. 👍【MULTI-FUNCTION】 The Circle Roasting Rack can be used as a potholder or a heat-insulating pot holder. The grid is encrypted, It can be directly placed on steamed buns and other small foods without falling. The Steamer Rack adopts a stacking design. The Baking Rack and the steaming rack can be stacked together, which does not occupy space and is more convenient for storage. The Baking Cooling Steaming Grilling Rack can also be hung on the wall to save desktop space and keep the desktop clean. 👍【GOOD HELPER IN THE KITCHEN】The round steaming rack is most suitable for baking, grilling, BBQ, and your favorite meat, fish, vegetables, and desserts. round cooling racks are used as a cake cooling rack or as a pot rack to cool baked goods. The cooking rack is convenient and easy to use. The round cooling rack is a good helper in the kitchen, making you fall in love with cooking. The steaming rack can be used in the dishwasher, saving time and effort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-kjn26OYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"homfanseec","source_asin":"B09KG42WJN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KG42WJN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KG42WJN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485643,"name":"Trademark Fine Art Water Lily Pond Painting by Danhui NAI, 24x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rAytgzG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features white flowers on lily pads in the water. Prominent Colors: Blue, Grey, Green, Tan Danhui Nai was born in mainland China and raised in an artistic household with her sculptor father and painter mother. Her natural passion for art was guided through classical training which she applies in her California studio to create beautiful, on-trend artwork in a variety of media. She studied interior design later in Paris and New York City. She worked in the textile industry in Manhattan, where she continued her studies and artistic development. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rAytgzG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B07LG15DHZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LG15DHZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LG15DHZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
