window.products.push({"id":485945,"name":"Large Heavy Duty Canvas Tote Bag with Zipper Top - Water Resistant Perfect for Travel, Boat, Shopping","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cukFmJH2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sun and Waves All Purpose Heavy Duty Tote Bag - Perfect for the Beach, Boating, Ocean, Swimming, Shopping and More! The Sun and Waves All Purpose Tote Bag by Blue Pack is destined to become your favorite go to tote bag. We created it to meet our own needs and serve a variety of purposes. You'll find a new use for it everyday. Use it to keep all your items secure with its full zipper top. The strong heavy duty polyester canvas material resists cuts, scratches, and dirt. The interior coating is highly water resistant so it will keep water outside and any liquid inside. It is high quality and light weight so you can take it anywhere and use it for just about anything. Our favorite uses are: on the boat, a day at the beach, near the pool, around town for shopping, groceries, and our favorite farmers market. The exterior pocket is great for grab and go items like a map, shopping list, or cell phone. Never use a cheap disposable plastic bag again. The Sun and Waves All Purpose Tote will last for many years. The sun and waves graphic will always bring pleasant memories to your mind and a smile to your face. Features Heavy Duty Top zipper with easy grip pull Exterior pocket Interior zippered pocket Interior key clip Interior PU water resistant coatingCarry with confidence. Reinforced carry handles wrap all the way around the bag for extra strength and heavy duty capacity Product Details Size: 22” x 15.5” x 7.5” Strap Drop: 8” Material: 600D Polyester Canvas Color Protection Fade proof fabric will maintain its color and look great for many years.. Quality Guarantee 30 Day 100% satisfaction guarantee for full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cukFmJH2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BabyNora","source_asin":"B07DXD1QXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DXD1QXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DXD1QXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485946,"name":"INSE Vacuum Cleaner, Corded Stick Vacuum 600W Powerful Motor Corded Vacuum Cleaner, 18000Kpa Handheld Stick Vacuum Cleaner for Pet Hair Hard Floor Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z+Hcg53rS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STRONG MOTOR - This INSE vacuum cleaner is equipped with a 600W strong motor which is stronger than most vacuum cleaners of its size, can generate up to 18000Pa powerful suction, perfect for hardwood floors, marble floors, tile, low pile carpet and can easily pick up all kinds of particles like dust, pet hair, pet litter, cereal, etc. A strong motor ensures decent suction, please don't worry motor part's temperature is higher than other parts. VERSATILE - The corded stick vacuum is easy to assemble and it has 3 different attachment heads - main floor brush & crevice tool & 2-in-1 brush. There is a button on the main floor brush, you can switch it when cleaning different surfaces such as hard floors or carpeted floors. When convert from a stick vacuum cleaner to a handheld vacuum cleaner, it performs decently on corners, stairs, shelves, and even on your car. HIGH-EFFICIENCY - The corded vacuum cleaner consists of a filtration system with durable high-efficiency filter pad, capable of capturing all of the microscopic dust. The filter pad protects the motor to ensure the vacuum cleaner works decently and helps to keep a clean and healthy home for you and your family. The white filter is pre-installed in the dust cup, please make sure to use the vacuum cleaner with the filter. PERFECT LENGTH - I5 corded stick vacuum cleaner allows up to 23ft long distance cleaning and most importantly you don't need to worry about running out of power. And the adjustable tube can be easily adjusted from 19 to 31 inches, the lightweight vacuum cleaner is very suitable for all family members to use. EASY TO USE - This vacuum is easy to operate. One click can start the vacuum, no need to keep pressing the switch. And one press can empty the 1L dust cup without making your hand dirty. The filter is washable and reusable, please leave it dry before using it. The key to maximum performance is having clean filters. Cleaning the filters will help your vacuum operate at peak efficiency. CONVENIENT STORAGE - The vacuum cleaner corded comes with tiny storage tools, making organizing a piece of cake. You can collect the long cord with the cord wrap. There is a hook that can be attached to the tube to store accessories, very space-saving and convenient. This vacuum cleaner enjoys a 12-month warranty and prompt after-sale service provided by INSE Support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Z+Hcg53rS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0B7HJKWD7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7HJKWD7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7HJKWD7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
