window.products.push({"id":485958,"name":"Howard Miller Corner II Curio Cabinet, Boyer Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2185.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q81AJA4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Boyer Curio Cabinet II by Howard Miller has an Boyer Cherry finish that’s lightly distressed with a crowned pediment, richly detailed leaves, shell at its center, and fluted columns. No Reach halogen light switch. Front locking door. Four adjustable shelves, give levels of display. Pad-Lock shelf clips. Plate grooves. Beveled glass. Adjustable floor levelers. Made in the USA.Howard C. Miller founded the company back in 1926, at the age of 21, and is based out of Zeeland, Michigan. Even though Howard Miller understood the need to create products that would be steeped in quality and value, he expected nothing less than the best. From gaining the title “World’s Largest Grandfather Clock Manufacturer” in the 1960s, to creating collectors’ cabinets in 1989, all the products have the same attention to detail and handcrafted ideals. We offer hundreds of items to complement any décor ranging from portable alarm clocks to desk sets to wall and mantel clocks to collectors’ cabinets to limited edition grandfather clocks. No matter the price of the purchase, you have the same assurance that Howard C. Miller provided when he began offering clocks more than 70 years ago: That quality is reflected both in the products we create, and in the people whose artistic talents we rely on to manufacture them. The legacy left by Howard C. Miller isn’t an easy one to emulate. But it’s the only way we know of doing business.Howard Miller offers a warranty which is our promise and commitment that our products have been manufactured using the finest materials and have been thoroughly inspected prior to being shipped from our facilities. Our warranty is available exclusively through authorized retailers only. Please inquire with any 3rd party seller prior to purchase to confirm warranty eligibility. Purchases made from unauthorized retailers will not be eligible for warranty services through Howard Miller or its authorized service center network.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q81AJA4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B0C5PBSJ1B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5PBSJ1B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5PBSJ1B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":485959,"name":"XSJHJDR 5L / 1.3Gallon Rectangular Metal Step Trash Can, Silent Trash can with Foot Pedal for Bathroom, Toilet, and Kitchen, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OM5npw53L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Stainless steel metal trash can is made of stainless steel, with a durable surface, good airtightness, and strong moisture and dirt resistance. The inner barrel is made of PP environmental protection plastic, which can be opened by lightly stepping on the thickened pedal. Usage Scenarios The compact metal trash can is very suitable for small spaces, suitable for offices, toilets, kitchens, bathrooms, living rooms and other places. Product Specifications Dimensions are 11.8x5.5x9 inches, capacity 1.3 gallons/5 liters capacity, weight 1kg Easy to Clean Metal surfaces can be wiped clean with a damp cloth, the plastic inner bucket can be removed and rinsed with water Easy to use, just lightly step on the foot pedal to open, the cover has the function of mute and deceleration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OM5npw53L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XSJHJDR","source_asin":"B0BML7CFBR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-485959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BML7CFBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BML7CFBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
